{"artifact_id":"ART-de11de6cee654e77","artifact_type":"AUDIO_TIMING_MAP","created_at":"2026-09-27T11:17:44.964576+00:00","created_by_role":"ALIGNMENT","dependencies":[{"artifact_id":"ART-ce387c3fce5546ee","output_hash":"8758e31224a12c8f3112600d2dbf732e0e0a0059411b4567e8ea99fbfd7d3e77"},{"artifact_id":"ART-bef1d4cecaf94b5d","output_hash":"cb975af6dd6b80f4a01ff1092fa202d2d72aadc3df107278d40596f25f8a4263"}],"input_hash":"f8031fbc3c44ff6152b24b6d0a6eda95b04633ddef4650c0b2182852541956b2","model":null,"output_hash":"64d382a382acee0147e5cec14939c76dea65f8b1640ca5b7baca778eff7871a5","payload":{"audio_artifact_id":"ART-ce387c3fce5546ee","audio_hash":"2d0278e8a2bfcc2c483b2958d60ba9d6f902990bb7b2a2edf7879ddbec2cf813","duration":84.76,"entries":[{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":11.04,"end":11.04,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":11.04,"start":0,"text":"想让视觉时间线跟着声音走，第一步是分清职责。脚本负责说什么，视觉节拍负责此刻看什么，声音决定它们什么时候出现。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-01","start":0.0,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":9.52,"end":20.56,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":20.56,"start":11.04,"text":"接着，给每个脚本段落绑定明确的视觉意图。先判断这段是在讲解、提问还是强调，模板和人物动作才有选择依据。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-02","start":11.04,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":7.64,"end":28.2,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":28.2,"start":20.56,"text":"然后做节拍拆分。一句话里有转折，就可以拆成两个节拍，不必让整句一直挂在屏幕上。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-03","start":20.56,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":10.28,"end":38.48,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":38.48,"start":28.2,"text":"时间线只决定画面何时出现。接入声音之后，以实际语音长度为主，再安排关键词、人物和信息元素的入场。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-04","start":28.2,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":10.08,"end":48.559999999999995,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":48.559999999999995,"start":38.48,"text":"还要检查镜头的读完时间。镜头过短，观众来不及读完信息；镜头太长却没有变化，画面也会停住，两边都要看。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-05","start":38.48,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":9.8,"end":58.36,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":58.36,"start":48.559999999999995,"text":"遇到对比内容，就把差异并排放好。先让观众看清变化，再让角色补一句解释，稳定结构比堆叠特效更容易复查。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-06","start":48.559999999999995,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":9.4,"end":67.76,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":67.76,"start":58.36,"text":"信息元素可以晚一点独立出现。等口播说到相关内容，再让图标、箭头或卡片出现，信息会更集中。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-07","start":58.36,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":8.12,"end":75.88000000000001,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":75.88000000000001,"start":67.76,"text":"已有道具的动作，就不重复叠加图标。人物负责身体语言，信息符号负责提示，两层不要互相抢位置。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-08","start":67.76,"word_ranges":[]},{"audio_id":"MED-7056b960d31e","duration":8.88,"end":84.76,"phrase_ranges":[{"end":84.76,"start":75.88000000000001,"text":"最后按脚本顺序生成，再按时间复查。声音讲到新信息时，对应画面就该进入，不要还停留在上一句。"}],"segment_id":"SEG-09","start":75.88000000000001,"word_ranges":[]}],"production_accepted":true,"provenance":{"detail":"Measured segment files; one subtitle phrase per segment, not forced word alignment","method":"MEASURED_SEGMENT_BOUNDARIES","version":"1","worker":"MEASURED_SEGMENT_CONCAT"},"script_artifact_id":"ART-bef1d4cecaf94b5d"},"project_id":"PRJ-bba515713057","prompt_version":null,"provenance":{},"provider":null,"revision":1,"status":"READY","worker":null}
